                            View offers →
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center mt-5">
            <a asp-controller="Marketplace" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-custom btn-lg">
                Explore Full Marketplace →
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section class="section how-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center mx-auto">
            <span class="eyebrow">HOW TIJARA WORKS</span>
            <h2>Trade with greater confidence</h2>
            <p>From discovering products to completing deliveries, Tijara simplifies agricultural trade.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="process-card">
                    <div class="process-number">01</div>
                    <div class="process-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i></div>
                    <h4>Discover Opportunities</h4>
                    <p>Find agricultural products, explore suppliers, and connect with potential trading partners.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="process-card">
                    <div class="process-number">02</div>
                    <div class="process-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake"></i></div>
                    <h4>Agree on Trade</h4>
                    <p>Discuss quantities, pricing, delivery terms, and establish clear trade agreements.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="process-card">
                    <div class="process-number">03</div>
                    <div class="process-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-box"></i></div>
                    <h4>Manage Your Transaction</h4>
                    <p>Track agreed milestones, payments, and delivery progress throughout the transaction.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- TRUST SECTION -->
<section class="section trust-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center gy-5">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <img src="~/images/tijara-trade.jpg" alt="African agricultural trade and logistics" class="trust-image" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <span class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR TRUST</span>
