                <p class="trust-description">
                    Agricultural trade involves more than finding a buyer or seller.
                    It requires clear agreements, reliable communication, and confidence at every stage.
                </p>

                <div class="trust-feature">
                    <span class="feature-check"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></span>
                    <div><h6>Business Verification</h6><p>Build confidence through business identity and verification.</p></div>
                </div>

                <div class="trust-feature">
                    <span class="feature-check"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></span>
                    <div><h6>Structured Trade Agreements</h6><p>Clearly define quantities, prices, payment terms, and delivery milestones.</p></div>
                </div>

                <div class="trust-feature">
                    <span class="feature-check"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></span>
                    <div><h6>Transaction Management</h6><p>Track payments, milestones, and delivery progress in one place.</p></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

